# MyApp CI/CD Deployment Lab

A hands-on DevOps project demonstrating different deployment approaches for the same containerized application.

The goal is to understand the complete application delivery lifecycle:

```text
code → build → artifact → deployment → verification → rollback
```

## Deployment Paths

### 1. AWS EC2 + Docker Compose ✅

Full CI/CD deployment:

```text
Developer
   │
   │ git push
   ▼
GitHub
   │
   ▼
GitHub Actions
   │
   ├── Build Docker image
   ├── Tag image with Git commit SHA
   └── Push image to GHCR
   │
   ▼
GitHub OIDC
   │
   ▼
AWS IAM Role
   │
   ▼
AWS Systems Manager (SSM)
   │
   ▼
AWS EC2
   │
   ▼
Docker Compose
   │
   ▼
MyApp
```

The complete deployment cycle was tested:

```text
v1
 ↓
git push
 ↓
automatic deployment
 ↓
v2
 ↓
rollback by image SHA
 ↓
v1
```

### 2. Proxmox + K3s + Argo CD 🚧

The second deployment path uses Kubernetes/GitOps:

```text
Developer
   │
   │ git push
   ▼
GitHub Actions
   │
